    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Vision of the Great Work.</strong> You pierce the veil of narrative and probability, perceiving the hidden scaffolding of the world.</p><ul><li><strong>Hex Alignment:</strong> You instinctively sense Sephirotic or Qliphothic tilt within 10 miles.</li><li><strong>Faction Trajectory:</strong> Once per Soma Break, you may ask the GM what a faction or important NPC is likely to attempt next if unopposed.</li><li><strong>Destiny Thread Pulse:</strong> Once per Soma Break, choose one creature you see. For 1 hour, they gain one of the following of your choice:<ul><li>+2 to all defense checks</li><li>Enemies have –2 to attack rolls against them</li><li>+2 to Insight (Soul), Diplomacy (Presence), and Perception (Mind) checks</li></ul></li><li><strong>Spark Resonance:</strong> You sense the presence and Sephirah-type of any active Spark within several hexes.</li></ul>",
